Keke’s Development
In 2024, Keke's cafe openings were a combination of company operated cafes and franchised cafes. We anticipate we will continue opening company operated cafes to accelerate the expansion of the brand into new markets with the intent of refranchising company operated cafes to franchisees over time. We anticipate the growth of the Keke’s brand to come primarily from the development of franchised cafes. As of December 25, 2024, we had 23 development agreements for 141 Keke’s franchised cafes.
Site Selection
The success of any restaurant is significantly influenced by its location. Our development teams work closely with franchisees and real estate brokers to identify sites that meet specific standards. Sites are evaluated based on a variety of factors, including but not limited to:
•demographics;
•traffic patterns;
•visibility;
•building constraints;
